docs(nature-round): correct the B cohort-flow amendment

The 4 November amendment said the manuscript states no cohort flow. It does:
a search for "379,896" missed the LaTeX form 379{,}896. The published flow
(402,119 -> 21,847 prevalent -> 376 "without follow-up" -> 379,896) does not
reproduce; the rerun starts at 401,743 and drops nobody for follow-up. The 376
are most likely participants without a medication report (unverified). No
verdict changes; the manuscript flow is corrected in revision r1.

